

WebSocket /api/ws/chat → Rasa/Dialogflow → Guide user + Tư vấn → "Nói chuyện chuyên viên" → Notify admin (Kafka/Email)



features/chatbot/
├── ChatbotController.java         # WebSocket endpoint
├── ChatWebSocketHandler.java      # STOMP messages
├── ChatService.java               # Call Rasa/Dialogflow + Notify admin
├── ChatMessage.java               # Entity (userId, message, botResponse)
└── AdminNotificationService.java  # Kafka/email admin
